             /SIGNAL-AVERAGING VERSION OF 'FADC':

             /CALLS WITH A SINGLE ARGUMENT RETURN CURRENT VALUE
             /OF THAT CHANNEL.  OPTIONAL SECOND ARGUMENT SPECI-
             /FIES AVERAGE OF THAT MANY READINGS.

       6531  ADLM=   6531            /SELECT CHANNEL
       6532  ADST=   6532            /START CONVERSION
       6533  ADRB=   6533            /READ BUFFER
       6534  ADSK=   6534            /SKIP ON DONE

13521  4560  FADC,   FIXIT           /ADC FUNCTION FOR THE LAB8/E
