13526  4522          PUSHJ           /GET REPETITION COUNT
13527  2010              EVAL
13530  4557          NEGATE          /DO THIS IN DOUBLE PRECISION
13531  4560          FIXIT
13532  3047          DCA OVER        /SO WE CAN TAKE 10^4 SAMPLES
13533  3046          DCA LORD

13534  7100  ADC2,   CLL             /CLEAR CARRY FOR PROPAGATION
13535  3051          DCA AC1H
13536  6534          ADSK            /LOOP OVERLAPS CONVERSION?
